@baseUrl = http://localhost:5062

### A dashboard request without authentication is rejected.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workflows

### Supply a local dashboard token through your HTTP client's secret storage.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workflows
Authorization: Bearer {{dashboardToken}}

### An unsigned webhook is rejected; use the simulator for signed requests.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/webhooks/jira
Content-Type: application/json

{"event":"issue.execution_requested","eventId":"00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001","issueKey":"DEMO-1001","repository":"example/repository"}
